    <string name="about_section_what">What the app does</string>
    <string name="about_what">Chess Puzzles helps you practise chess tactics. Each puzzle comes from the Lichess puzzle database, tells you what to find (for example, checkmate in 2) and has a rating that shows how hard it is. You can also learn common openings move by move, then play them from memory. Everything is stored on your phone, so the app works without internet.</string>
    <string name="about_section_privacy">Privacy</string>
    <string name="about_privacy_no_data">Chess Puzzles does not collect, send or share any personal data.</string>
    <string name="about_privacy_no_permissions">It does not ask for any permissions, not even internet access.</string>
    <string name="about_privacy_no_tracking">No account, no ads, no analytics and no crash reporting.</string>
    <string name="about_privacy_on_device">Your progress is saved on your phone. The app itself never sends it anywhere.</string>
